  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v3.71.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.70.0:\n\n- Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into claude/project-thread-9lzc74 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Compare slider values bit for bit rather than with Equals ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [minor] Add ImGuiApp.EnableExtensions to turn on ImGui extensions after launch ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Guard the bipolar fill test's difference bounds with a pattern ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [minor] Add ValueSlider, a slider whose number stays readable ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Match the added font with a pattern rather than .Value ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Drop an unneeded unsafe modifier ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Let an application draw its interface in another face [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Let an application leave out the built-in Accessibility and Debug menus [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
